# L §5.16 table: discrete(w for k in IDX) has "no mean (keys aren't numbers)"; and since round 18 (C1-47) "mean(d) of a
# distribution value is refused (LOAD-RANDOM, A-42)" whatever the distribution (snap11: LOAD-UNIT, as no mean).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
index ks = [ka, kb]
input w[k in ks]: num

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  w[*] = 1

ask q1: mean(discrete(w[k] for k in ks))
=== expect
refused: LOAD-RANDOM ...
